    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "What did famous people in history—such as William Shakespeare and Vincent van Gogh—look like? It seems impossible for us to know. However, Becca Saladin Segovia is working to bring them back to life."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Segovia is an American artist. She turns paintings and "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "statues",
      "ref": "v-statue"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of historical figures into "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "realistic",
      "ref": "v-realistic"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "portraits",
      "ref": "v-portrait"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "“I loved history a lot. But I felt like it was not so real,” Segovia said. “There is too much "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "dry content",
      "zh": "枯燥无味的内容"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". And none of it can show us what people in history looked like. I like making them look more realistic. In this way, we can be reminded that history is real. It’s all about real events and real people.”"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "To create her portraits, Segovia mainly uses Photoshop. AI tools also help her to do the work. Each portrait takes her three to eight hours to finish. Sometimes, she has to spend more time on a portrait. That’s usually because the design of the figure’s clothing includes many small details."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Segovia also faces some other difficulties. The biggest of them all is to find "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "accurate",
      "ref": "v-accurate"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " paintings of the figures. To solve this problem, she usually uses modern "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "descriptions",
      "ref": "v-description"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of the historical figures to create her portraits."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
